# .vercelignore
# `vercel deploy` walks the filesystem itself (not just tracked git files) and
# by default only skips what .gitignore already excludes. .claude/worktrees/
# holds full nested checkouts (each with its own node_modules symlink) from
# concurrent Claude Code sessions/workflows — walking into those blew the
# upload past Vercel's 15000-file limit (18308 seen 2026-09-15). None of this
# is needed to build or serve the app.
.claude/worktrees/
.claude/worktrees

# Large non-deploy artifacts that accumulate over time and are never needed
# to build/serve the app.
docs/design/screens/
docs/audits/
e2e/
__tests__/
playwright-report/
test-results/
coverage/
.expo/
.cursor/
